.env*.local
# Regenerated by Next on every `dev` and `build`, and dev/build write DIFFERENT
# paths into it (`.next/dev/types/…` vs `.next/types/…`), so a tracked copy is
# dirty after any dev-server start and fails `format:check` on top. Nothing
# needs the committed file: `tsc --noEmit` passes without it, and the Docker
# build runs `next build`, which writes it.
client/web/next-env.d.ts
# Generated at build time by @mantle/app-build's build-runtime (npm: @crossworks/app-build)
client/web/public/app-runtime/
# Electron: the staged copy of the built owner UI + packaged artifacts
client/desktop/ui/
client/desktop/release/
